                <pb facs="0167" n="95" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg95"/>

                <head>61.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Trescot to Mr. Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Special Mission of thé United States in South America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Lima, Peru</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1882-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            9, 1882</date>. (Received June 2.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 25.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to forward herewith dispatches from
                    Mr. Walker Blaine to myself referring to his recent visit to Bolivia.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>WM. HENRY TRESCOT.</signed></closer>






